{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06594","headline":"晚霁中园喜赦作 · 储光羲","name":"晚霁中园喜赦作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五月黄梅时，阴气蔽远迩。\n浓云连晦朔，菰菜生隣里。\n落日烧霞明，农夫知雨止。\n几悲衽席湿，长叹垣墙毁。\n曭朗天宇开，家族跃以喜。\n涣汗发大号，坤元更资始。\n散衣出中园，小径尚滑履。\n池光摇万象，倏忽灭复起。\n嘉树如我心，欣欣岂云已。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06594.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06594","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}